{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cat &amp; Farm Pals is a fun match game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match the same animals to get points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match more animals for a higher score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete on leaderboards to win trophies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Match and Win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match the same animals to create new ones. Earn points for each combination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181470/extras/birletirme-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745051948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect Trophies, Be a Leader!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with friends or global players to climb the rankings and win trophies! Join weekly and monthly competitions to secure your spot on the leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181470/extras/kupa-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745051948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control the area, don't lose!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merging animals can move others, so watch the area! If an animal goes out of bounds, you lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181470/extras/elenme-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1745051948\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3181470?t=1745051948","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3181470?t=1745051948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181470/302581b294395307ae05d33b5de50b676e90767f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745051948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor